  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This section provides you with guidance to conduct Post Tender Clarifications and Negotiation where appropriate.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is important that any discussions at this stage are fully documented.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For complex regulated procurements, you may find some of the guidance and tools in Route 3 to be of benefit.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration must also be given to Planning , Sustainable Procurement and Risk Management throughout this stage of the Journey.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Tender Clarifications",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The objective at the clarification stage is to clarify the tenders as submitted i.e. it is contact between you and the bidder(s) purely to clarify aspects of the tender which are unclear or abnormal.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Tender, or bid clarifications, may be required during the evaluation of tenders. This may be the case where aspects of the bid:",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Are unclear or contain minor errors e.g. arithmetical mistakes and/or;",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Seem strange. For example, if a bid appears abnormally low or especially high on price;",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Require clarification on quality performance or particular terms and conditions of contracts.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In seeking clarification, all communications with bidders must be properly recorded so that an audit trail is maintained. If PCS-Tender is being utilised, this can be recorded on the system in the messaging area.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should examine bids to ensure that bidders:",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Are not making fraudulent claims;",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Are not making fraudulent claims;",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Have delivered similar types of work, if they have claimed to do so.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Have delivered similar types of work, if they have claimed to do so.",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In doing so the following points should be considered:",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Checklist",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Post Tender Clarification - Points to Consider",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Clarification - Points to Consider"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A checklist of points to consider once you have received all bids.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Clarification - Points to Consider"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "All bidders who meet the tender requirements should be given the same opportunity to engage in tender/bid clarification.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Clarification - Points to Consider"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Extreme caution and care must be used to avoid either unfairness to potential bidders or the impression of unfairness to some bidders.",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Clarification - Points to Consider"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Post Tender Negotiation",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Post Tender Negotiation (PTN) should not be confused with 'tender' or 'bid clarification'.",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Tender Clarification is contact between you and bidder(s) purely to clarify aspects of the tender which are unclear or abnormal whereas PTN is contact between you and the leading bidder (possibly multiple leading bidders) to improve or enhance Value for Money (VFM).",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It's important to remember that PTN:",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Is conducted after the receipt of formal tenders and before the award of any contract. It is your role to ensure any PTN does not change the outcome of the competition;",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Should be handled as a separate exercise from Tender Clarification;",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "May be used to refine and improve bid(s) from the leading bidder(s) to ensure that prices, delivery or associated contract terms are competitive;",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Should not distort competition. That is a bidder, who is not clearly in the lead, should not be given a chance at PTN to improve its offer. Nor should any changes be made which would result in a contract being awarded on terms more favourable to a bidder;",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Remains a stage of the procurement process and the competing bidders must be treated in an honest, fair and ethical manner. Bid confidentiality must be retained.",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This list is not meant to be exhaustive. Any negotiation process requires you to define the points most relevant to the procurement exercise and the specific bid under negotiation.",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "PTN should be a controlled and documented process. It should not be used automatically on all procurements.",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before engaging in PTN, the following criteria should be met:",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00036",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "there should be a considered approach to improving VfM;",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00037",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the approval of senior management must be sought in advance of any PTN initiation or activity.",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00038",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A clear \"audit trail\" should be available to illustrate the process was conducted fairly and transparently. The PTN record should show:",
      "ordinal": 38,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00039",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The justification for PTN;",
      "ordinal": 39,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00040",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The approval for PTN (at a suitably senior level of management);",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00041",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The aim of the negotiation;",
      "ordinal": 41,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00042",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The precise record of all exchanges, both written and verbal. This should demonstrate that the negotiations were conducted by trained and experienced purchasing staff;",
      "ordinal": 42,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00043",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The approval for the award of contract.",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00044",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When carried out with openness and mutual trust negotiations can strengthen relationships with bidders.",
      "ordinal": 44,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00045",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Example Negotiation Topics",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00046",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The potential areas for negotiation will differ for every contract. Typical topics for PTN might include:",
      "ordinal": 46,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00047",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Terms of payment;",
      "ordinal": 47,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00048",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Quality of goods or services;",
      "ordinal": 48,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00049",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Supply and cost of spare parts;",
      "ordinal": 49,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00050",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Earlier delivery or completion dates;",
      "ordinal": 50,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00051",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Warranties and guarantees;",
      "ordinal": 51,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00052",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Documentation requirements;",
      "ordinal": 52,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00053",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Expediting and inspection procedures;",
      "ordinal": 53,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00054",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Maintenance and support;",
      "ordinal": 54,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00055",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Repair or after-sales service;",
      "ordinal": 55,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00056",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Compensation for failure to meet specified requirements (e.g. of delivery, quality etc.);",
      "ordinal": 56,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00057",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Sustainable Procurement, possible Community Benefits;",
      "ordinal": 57,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00058",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Procedures for remedial action for unsatisfactory service.",
      "ordinal": 58,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00059",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Negotiations in relation to price or other areas where bid improvements may be possible should not take place .",
      "ordinal": 59,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00060",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Abnormally Low Tenders",
      "ordinal": 60,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics",
        "Abnormally Low Tenders"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00061",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where tenders appear abnormally low in relation to the supplies and services being offered, organisations should clarify the price or costs proposed in the tender.",
      "ordinal": 61,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics",
        "Abnormally Low Tenders"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00062",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "These clarifications may relate to some of the following:",
      "ordinal": 62,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics",
        "Abnormally Low Tenders"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00063",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The cost of the manufacturing process for the services provided;",
      "ordinal": 63,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics",
        "Abnormally Low Tenders"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00064",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The proposed technical solutions;",
      "ordinal": 64,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics",
        "Abnormally Low Tenders"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00065",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The originality of the supplies or services proposed by the bidder;",
      "ordinal": 65,
      "heading_path": [
