      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00068",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If it is found that the tender is abnormally low due to a breach of environmental, social or employment law obligations, you should reject the tender. This includes collective agreements and certain international law measures.",
      "ordinal": 68,
      "heading_path": [
        "Tender Clarifications",
        "Post Tender Negotiation",
        "Example Negotiation Topics",
        "Abnormally Low Tenders"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00069",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before awarding the contract you should ensure you receive the most up-to-date supporting documents e.g. certificates. These documents should be requested in the selection stage of the tender. For Framework Agreements this should be done prior to a contract based on the Framework being awarded.",
      "ordinal": 69,
      "heading_path": [
